{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_event_stream_event_stream", "label": "DevTools event-stream panel (page)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/devtools/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_event_stream_live_tail", "label": "Live tail of the system event bus", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/devtools/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Per-session seq column where a gap means events were dropped; pause discards rather than buffers, because resuming into a wall of everything that happened meanwhile is not what the button promises."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_event_stream_observer_installed_on_subscribe", "label": "Nothing is recorded until you look", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/devtools/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The observer is installed when this panel subscribes and removed when the last one leaves, unlike the tracing panel which records from attach. The event bus is always live, so an always-on observer would run on every actor start and stop for a panel nobody opened; the consequence is that the panel opens empty and an idle system shows nothing."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_event_stream_drop_reporting", "label": "Reporting a tail that falls behind", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/devtools/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The server drops the oldest past its cap and tells the panel how many; the panel says so above the table, because a reader draws conclusions from what is not there and a tail that silently skips is worse than one that admits it."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_event_stream_cluster_topics", "label": "Cluster PubSub topics list", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/devtools/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Topic names only: the mediator CurrentTopics reply carries no subscriber counts, and changing a cluster wire type for one column in one panel is not a trade worth making. A never-started extension is reported distinctly from started-with-no-topics."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_event_stream_payload_exposure", "label": "Event payloads are your data", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/devtools/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The tail shows event contents, so switch it off with panels: { eventStream: false } anywhere that matters \u2014 the same call as for the time-travel and dead-letter panels."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_event_stream_event_stream", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_event_stream_live_tail", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/devtools/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_event_stream_observer_installed_on_subscribe", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_event_stream_live_tail", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/devtools/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_event_stream_drop_reporting", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_event_stream_live_tail", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/devtools/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_event_stream_event_stream", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_event_stream_cluster_topics", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/devtools/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_event_stream_payload_exposure", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_event_stream_live_tail", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/devtools/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_event_stream_live_tail", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_operations_dead_letters_dead_letter", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/devtools/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_event_stream_payload_exposure", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_dead_letters_payload_sanitisation", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/devtools/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_event_stream_payload_exposure", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_overview_panels", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/devtools/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_event_stream_observer_installed_on_subscribe", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_overview_cost", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/devtools/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_observability_devtools_event_stream_drop_reporting", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_io_broker_actor_base_outbound_buffer", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.65, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/observability/devtools/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}], "hyperedges": []}